#: ../../source/p-reduce_readme.md:3
msgid "Reduce a list of values using promises into a promise for a value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-reduce_readme.md:5
msgid ""
"Useful when you need to calculate some accumulated value based on async "
"resources."
msgstr ""

